WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.425
Current is the flow of free electrons, pushed round by the battery.

2
00:00:05.125 --> 00:00:10.600
Red plusses are atoms that lost an electron. Blue minuses are free electrons.

3
00:00:11.526 --> 00:00:15.251
The battery pushes the electrons round. They are not used up.

4
00:00:20.167 --> 00:00:23.967
Fewer volts: a weaker push, a slower drift, a dimmer bulb.
